        <h3 class="hm-pipe__title">Every framework runs on the same five-stage pipeline.</h3>
        <p class="hm-pipe__lead">Extract, validate, transform, load, publish &mdash; safe to re-run, with rejected rows quarantined rather than quietly dropped. Start a run and watch each stage report in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hm-pipe__controls">
        <button class="pill pill--primary pill--sm" type="button" data-pipeline-run>Run the pipeline</button>
        <button class="pill pill--ghost pill--sm" type="button" data-pipeline-reset>Reset</button>
        <span class="hm-pipe__state">Stage: <b data-pipeline-out="stage">Idle</b></span>
      </div>

      <ol class="hm-pipe__stages">
        <li class="hm-pipe__stage pg-pipe__stage" data-pipeline-stage="extract"><span class="hm-pipe__stage-n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-t">Extract</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-d">Warehouse read replica, since the last watermark.</span></li>
        <li class="hm-pipe__stage pg-pipe__stage" data-pipeline-stage="validate"><span class="hm-pipe__stage-n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-t">Validate</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-d">Schema contract checked; bad rows quarantined.</span></li>
        <li class="hm-pipe__stage pg-pipe__stage" data-pipeline-stage="transform"><span class="hm-pipe__stage-n" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-t">Transform</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-d">Currency, labels and grain normalised.</span></li>
        <li class="hm-pipe__stage pg-pipe__stage" data-pipeline-stage="load"><span class="hm-pipe__stage-n" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-t">Load</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-d">Idempotent upsert into the reporting mart.</span></li>
        <li class="hm-pipe__stage pg-pipe__stage" data-pipeline-stage="publish"><span class="hm-pipe__stage-n" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-t">Publish</span><span class="hm-pipe__stage-d">Dashboards refreshed, run logged, team notified.</span></li>
      </ol>

      <dl class="hm-pipe__outs">
        <div class="hm-pipe__out"><dt class="hm-pipe__out-k">Rows read</dt><dd class="hm-pipe__out-v" data-pipeline-out="rows">&mdash;</dd></div>
        <div class="hm-pipe__out"><dt class="hm-pipe__out-k">Rows loaded</dt><dd class="hm-pipe__out-v" data-pipeline-out="loaded">&mdash;</dd></div>
        <div class="hm-pipe__out"><dt class="hm-pipe__out-k">Quarantined</dt><dd class="hm-pipe__out-v" data-pipeline-out="rejected">&mdash;</dd></div>
        <div class="hm-pipe__out"><dt class="hm-pipe__out-k">Tables</dt><dd class="hm-pipe__out-v" data-pipeline-out="tables">&mdash;</dd></div>
        <div class="hm-pipe__out"><dt class="hm-pipe__out-k">Run time</dt><dd class="hm-pipe__out-v" data-pipeline-out="duration">&mdash;</dd></div>
      </dl>

      <div class="hm-pipe__log pg-pipe__log" data-pipeline-log></div>
      <p class="u-sr" data-pipeline-status></p>

      <p class="hm-pipe__foot">This is the run pattern behind the <a class="textlink" href="/work/freelance-automation-bi">automation &amp; BI build</a> in my case studies &mdash; and you can take it apart yourself in the <a class="textlink" href="/playground">playground</a>.</p>
